              <dd>模擬巡航多遠就換算多少步，一魚兩吃<span class="story-tag story-tag--pro">Pro</span><span class="story-tag story-tag--soon">規劃中</span></dd>
            </div>
            <div class="story-ledger__row">
              <dt>每分鐘防爆上限</dt>
